   "title": "Weather Radar Aasmaan Ki Invisible Baarish Ko Kaise Dekh Leta Hai?",
   "description": "Aasmaan mein door baarish ho rahi hai, aapko dikh bhi nahi rahi, phir bhi weather radar ko kaise pata chal jaata hai? Is short mein samjho radar ka asli science: electromagnetic waves (microwave pulses), reflection yaani echo, Doppler effect aur baarish ko mm per hour mein naapne ka tarika.\n\nRadar ki microwave pulses baadal ki chhoti boondon se nikal jaati hain lekin baarish ki badi boondon se takraakar wapas aati hain. Echo kitni der mein lauta usse doori pata chalti hai, echo kitna strong hai usse baarish kitni bhaari hai. Doppler weather radar boondon ki speed aur direction bhi naap leta hai, aur ek taraf aati aur doosri taraf jaati boondein ghoomte toofaan (rotating storm, tornado jaisa pattern) ki chetavani deti hain. Isi se IMD aur weather forecast aapke shehar tak baarish pahunchne se pehle alert de paate hain.\n\nAisi hi conceptual clarity ke liye Merit Mantra ko subscribe karein aur comment mein batayein agla sawal kya ho.",
